Now carry on to consider the expression for 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbf{{v}}$
\end_inset

.
\begin_inset Formula \begin{align*}
\mathbf{{v}=} & 2\frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\rho\partial\zeta}\rho^{B}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+4\frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\zeta^{2}}\left(\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}\cdot\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\right)\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\zeta}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\\
= & \frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\rho\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\rho^{B}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+\left[\frac{\partial^{2}e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{2}}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{2}}-\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{\left|\nabla\rho\right|^{3}}\right]\left(\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}\cdot\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\right)\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho_{0}+\frac{\partial e_{xc}}{\partial\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\frac{1}{2\left|\nabla\rho\right|}\boldsymbol{{\nabla}}\rho^{B}\end{align*}

\end_inset

Reformulating this using the terms returned by 
\shape smallcaps
dftpot1 
\shape default
and the definition
\begin_inset Formula \[
\texttt{FACR=vxc(frz)*B0+}\left(\texttt{vxc(fzz)-vxc(fz0)/RHOGRD}\right)\texttt{*BR}\]

\end_inset

we arrive at
\begin_inset Formula \begin{align*}
\texttt{VT(I)=} & \texttt{FACR*RHG(I)/RHOGRD+0.5*vxc(fz0)*B3(I)/RHOGRD}\\
 & \texttt{+}\left(\texttt{2*vxc(fzg)+vxc(fgg)}\right)\texttt{*BR*RHG(I)/RHOGRD+vxc(frg)*B0*RHG(I)}\\
 & \texttt{+0.5*vxc(fg0)*B3(I)}\end{align*}

\end_inset

This is not the terms implemented in the code! The first two terms above
 can be identified in the expression for 
\family typewriter
VT(I)
\family default
 on line 108 in 
\family typewriter
dftaux.F
\family default
 with the exception of the multiplicative prefactors.
 In the implemented code both of these terms have a numerical prefactor
 2, whereas in the above expression, the first term has no prefactor and
 the second one has a factor one half.
 In addition, the second and third rows are completely missing.
\end_layout

